      "side": 1,
      "message": "Rather than use this rather bogus test data, I wonder if we should just create a fairly minimal real one.\n(That also avoids the whole Box\u003cdyn\u003e thing.)\n\nFixed, or random, CDIs, no prior DICE nodes - a little like https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Virtualization/pvmfw/src/bcc.rs;drc\u003dc5e5fa3dc179276981acd26ea27e1b599bcb69ea;l\u003d55.",
