      "writtenOn": "2023-09-21T13:08:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The sample chain is fake data - it\u0027s mostly intended for testing. So we shouldn\u0027t be using it in production code.\n\nI\u0027m suggesting creating a valid but minimal DICE chain.\n\nBut - what does it mean for Rialto to support a non-protected VM? Such a VM shouldn\u0027t get any attestation certificate, should it?",
      "parentUuid": "ba78216f_fa906538",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 158,
